        H * ((∑ d ∈ S, c d) - 1)| ≤
        |∑ d ∈ S, c d * (coprimeHarmonicSum W (Q / d) - H)| +
          |H * ((∑ d ∈ S, c d) - 1)| := abs_add_le _ _
